1
00:00:00,323 --> 00:00:02,153
(Sheldon:)It worked.

2
00:00:03,201 --> 00:00:05,411
(Sheldon:)It really worked.

3
00:00:05,995 --> 00:00:09,585
(Sheldon:)They said I was mad, but it worked.

4
00:00:15,380 --> 00:00:18,550
(Sheldon:)Oh, no, not Morlocks.

5
00:00:18,716 --> 00:00:21,346
(Sheldon:)Not flesh-eating Morlocks.

6
00:00:21,511 --> 00:00:25,051
Help!

7
00:00:27,392 --> 00:00:28,562
[SCREAMS]

8
00:00:31,729 --> 00:00:33,899
(Leonard:)Sheldon, are you okay?

9
00:00:34,607 --> 00:00:36,817
(Sheldon:)We have to get rid of the time machine.

10
00:00:36,985 --> 00:00:39,405
(Leonard:)It is a little big for the living room,
isn't it?

11
00:00:40,405 --> 00:00:42,735
(Sheldon:)Yeah, that's the problem. It's too big.

12
00:00:43,324 --> 00:00:45,954
(Leonard:)I'm glad you agree.
I hired some guys to help us move it.

13
00:00:46,119 --> 00:00:48,079
(Leonard:)Come on in, fellas.

14
00:00:50,582 --> 00:00:53,122
(Sheldon:)Oh, no, Morlocks.

15
00:00:53,293 --> 00:00:55,083
(Sheldon:)Eat him, eat him.

16
00:00:55,253 --> 00:00:56,713
[SCREAMING]

17
00:00:56,880 --> 00:00:57,920
[GASPING]

18
00:01:00,216 --> 00:01:04,636
(Sheldon:)Leonard!

